transport-core, the RDMA transport library used by net-sircl
Copyright 2026 SparkRing contributors
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE.

Contains RDMA setup and planning code from the collective library and its C
implementation, libsircl, in the SparkRing project. Derived from project
revisions 947bce1e (collective library) and 7b81b968 (network plugin).
transport-core contains no NVIDIA NCCL code.

RoCEnante attribution
---------------------
Includes transport design derived from RoCEnante, the b12x RoCE collectives
from Local Inference Lab (https://github.com/local-inference-lab), licensed
under Apache-2.0. RoCEnante was written by Jason (original-el8) in
local-inference-lab/b12x PR 295, with dual-rail striping and graph-collective
work by Luke Alonso (lukealonso). b12x is developed in FlashInfer at
flashinfer/experimental/b12x.
